<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_d845c31c> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "A VKontakte user was fined for publishing an image, which the court described as “depicting four situations, where in the first there is a seated person looking at a monitor and reading 'straight gay', in the last part, there is an LGBT flag.” According to the court, this image “was aimed at promoting LGBT and non-traditional sexual orientation.” The exact image is unknown. The amount of the fine has been redacted from the court ruling. This individual was fined four times by the same judge on the same day for posting on VK."@en .
<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#1077758948112> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_8724a082> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "An individual was fined after inspectors documented that she had posted on her VKontakte profile an image depicting “two men of the same sex kissing”. The exact content is unavailable. The same individual was fined at least three times by the same judge on the same day for posting images."@en .
