<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_bdb81073> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The editor-in-chief of the TV channel “TOCHKA TV” was fined for airing the music video “Stranger” (2012) by Nikolai Baskov, labelled “16+”. The court stated that this video “contained information demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences” and should have had the label “18+”. According to the judicial expert analysis, the music video is a relationship story between two men placed in the “atmosphere of hedonism and debauchery, which is realised primarily through repeated scenes of non-verbal sensual interaction between two persons of the same biological sex (female) in a sexual context.”"@en .
