<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_cbb84503> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "A VKontakte user was fined for publishing three videos, two of which were pornographic (“sex between a man and a MAN”), and another one depicted “kisses between a guy and a guy”, published in 2010. The court stated that these videos were “related to the promotion of non-traditional sexual relations of the LGBT community” and were of “an extremist nature”."@en .
