<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_b9b95aa4> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "A VKontakte user was fined for posting an image “containing persons of the same sex (gender)”. According to the court, the image depicted the “signs of propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations, propaganda of norms of non-traditional sexual relations”. The defence argued that the image was art and depicted models. This individual was fined nine times by the same judge for posting images on VK."@en .
