<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_cc596aa1> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The project manager at “Mangalib”, a platform for online comics and manga, was prosecuted for several publications. The publication in this case is “Sex Life With My Beast Partner” (Komagome, 2018). The court stated that this “manga in the shojo genre contained a non-episodic depiction of non-traditional sexual relations between female characters with a beast-like creature (perceived as an animal) in a romantic and erotic context: hugs, kisses, sexually explicit actions, etc.” This individual was fined at least 12 times for different publications. The company “MangaLib” was also fined at least 12 times."@en .
