<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_eba38c47> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The executive of the streaming service “Megafon TV” was fined for the film “Love Is Love Is Love” (Eleanor Coppola, 2021), because it “demonstrated non-traditional sexual relations on the timestamp 01:14:50-01:15:10”, namely the “messages about a same-sex wedding and the display of images of two women, accompanied by the words 'my picture, with my wife and our son'.” The company, which owns the streaming service, was also fined for the same title (see case 05-0915/2023)."@en .
