<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_50ca2710> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The streaming service “Kinopoisk” was fined for the series “Legacies” (Julie Plec, 2018). As the judicial experts explained, “non-traditional sexual relationships and preferences in the series are approved through the support and acceptance of such unions by the series’ characters, without condemning such relationships [...] the series is aimed at forming a positive attitude towards non-traditional sexual relationships and preferences, as well as their romanticisation through the use of artistic and psychological techniques and means.”"@en .
