<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_5470bbf1> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The bookshop “Podpisnyye izdaniya” was fined for selling the books “On Women” (2023) and “Against Interpretation and Other Essays” (1966) by Susan Sontag and “Everybody: A Book About Freedom” (2021) by Olivia Laing. According to the court's press secretary, the books “contain signs of propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations and ideas of the LGBT movement, which was banned by the [Supreme] court.” The exact content that constituted the violation is unknown."@en .
