<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_49e4ef4f> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "A Saint Petersburg company was fined for online advertisements in VKontakte. One ad was about the nightclub “Born”, “aimed primarily at recreation for people of non-traditional sexual orientation”, according to the court case. Another ad mentioned the gay sauna “Near the Circus”. One piece of evidence in the case was a report to the police by a man who saw the club's advertisement online and decided to visit. As he stated, he saw some rooms in the club that “shocked” him."@en .
