<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_bfd15862> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "A foreign national was detained and ordered to leave the country for posting a profile on the social media website “Drug Vokrug”. According to the court, the profile owner “being a male, posts photos of himself in a women's dress and a long-haired wig, and refers to himself in the feminine gender”, suggesting “intimate services for non-traditional relations”."@en .
