<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_3fddb099> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The project manager at “Mangalib”, a platform for online comics and manga, was prosecuted for several publications. The publication in this case is “Boo! It’s Sex” (Danielle Corsetto, Monica Gallagher, 2018). According to the court, this is a comic book “dedicated to the depiction of love and romantic relationships between girls (kisses, hugs, sensitive touches),” which “contains information promoting non-traditional sexual relationships and (or) preferences.” This individual was fined at least 12 times for different publications. The company “MangaLib” was also fined at least 12 times."@en .
