<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_3b63e42f> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "An individual was fined for a video published on TikTok. According to the court, this video “promoted non-traditional sexual relations” and depicted “a young man with headphones on, long hair, glasses in a black T-shirt, and text over it”; “[the defendant] himself is present in the video, [...] moving to the music”. It is not said what text was on the video. The same indivudual was prosecuted at least 7 times for different TikTok videos."@en .
