<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_942aa403> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The editor-in-chief of the music TV channel “ТNТ MUSIC” was fined for airing the music video “Hallucination” by Regard and Years & Years. According to the court, the music video “demonstrated non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences” among minors, because the TV channel marked it “16+”. It is not specified which scenes exactly constituted the violation."@en .
