<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_53f9a976> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The editor-in-chief of “MOST.media” was fined for the article “You sit and think that God will punish you”. The court established that “the article, through the personal stories of its protagonists, demonstrates how people with non-traditional sexual preferences try to preserve their identity and overcome the homophobia that surrounds them.” According to the judicial expert, “the article uses verbal means of influence to form a positive attitude towards non-traditional sexual relations and (or) preferences” and its characters “are very successful and attractive individuals”, which constitutes the “promotion of non-traditional sexual relations”."@en .
