<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_eb0139f4> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "Rapper Vacío was fined for “dissemination of information aimed at the formation of non-traditional sexual attitudes and the attractiveness of non-traditional sexual relationships” using Telegram. The court mentioned that the information the rapper shared was related to his participation in the celebrities' “Almost naked” themed party organised by the TV host and blogger Nastya Ivleeva. According to the court, this party was “aimed at promoting non-traditional sexual relations”, but it is not specified what information exactly constituted the violation."@en .
