<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_afe1c4be> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The project manager at “Mangalib”, a platform for online comics and manga, was prosecuted for several publications. The publication in this case is “Revolutionary Girl Utena: The Adolescence of Utena” (Be-Papas, 1999), which, according to the court, contains “images promoting non-traditional sexual relations among minors”. This individual was fined at least 12 times for different publications. The company “MangaLib” was also fined at least 12 times."@en .
