<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_128d33fe> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "“MangaLib”, a platform for online comics and manga, was fined for publications on its website. The publication in this case is “Reincarnation Coliseum: The Weakest Skill Conquers the Strongest Women and Creates a Harem” (Harawata Saizou, 2022). From the court decision: “This material contains non-episodic depictions of non-traditional sexual relationships between characters who form a harem of women conquered by [the protagonist]. This depiction is represented by several illustrations of female characters in romantic and sexual contexts: touching, hugging, kissing, sex (including group sex), etc.”. The court stated that “the information displayed can be classified as revealing signs of a socio-cultural threat to the national security of the Russian Federation in terms of the protection of traditional values, since it reveals signs of ideological and psychological influence on the recipient in the form of the imposition of a destructive ideology (propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations).” This is one of at least 12 cases in a serial persecution of “MangaLib”. The manager of “MangaLib” was also prosecuted at least 12 times for different publications."@en .
