<https://dataout.org/rdf/reference/ru_law#article_6_21_2_part_1> <https://schema.org/description> "Distributing information among minors demonstrating “non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences”, including descriptions or depictions of such preferences, or information “capable of causing minors to desire to change their sex”. Does not apply to cases covered by part 2 of Article 6.21. Individuals may be fined RUB 50K–100K; officials RUB 100K–200K; and legal entities RUB 800K–1M, or have their activities suspended for up to 90 days."@en .
