<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_625321bb> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://dataout.org/ontology#MonitoringRecord> .
<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_1423f46f> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "Igor Kochetkov, an LGBTQIA+ activist and the chair of the “Russian LGBT Network”, was fined for two posts on his Telegram channel. One post advertised an online poll for queer people; another was about the experiences of an LGBTQIA+ community resisting the state's repressive mechanisms. The judicial expertise found these posts to “contain information promoting non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences”. The court also stated that these posts contained “signs of a socio-cultural threat to the national security of the Russian Federation in terms of the protection of traditional values”. In April 2026, the “Russian LGBT Network” was designated an “extremist organisation”."@en .
