<https://dataout.org/rdf/reference/ru_law#article_6_21_2_part_4> <https://schema.org/description> "Distributing information among minors demonstrating “non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences”, including descriptions or depictions of such preferences, or information “capable of causing minors to desire to change their sex” by a foreign national or stateless person via mass media or internet. Does not apply to cases covered by part 8 of Article 6.21. Punishment: RUB 100K–200K fine with administrative expulsion from Russia, or detention for up to 15 days with subsequent expulsion."@en .
