<https://dataout.org/rdf/reference/ru_law#article_6_21_part_1> <https://schema.org/description> "Distributing information or carrying out public actions intended to promote “non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences, sex change, or refusal to have children”. Individuals may be fined RUB 50K–100K; officials RUB 100K–200K; and legal entities RUB 800K–1M, or have their activities suspended for up to 90 days."@en .
