<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_23db2edc> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The legal entity “OMT”, which owns the TV channel “O2TV”, was fined for broadcasting the music video “Крылья” (“Wings”) by Dezery (2019). The court qualified the broadcast as propaganda, holding that the video promoted “the attractiveness of non-traditional sexual relations and preferences” and “a distorted perception of the social equivalence of traditional and non-traditional sexual relations.” Although the channel argued that the clip had been aired at night, marked 18+, and partially blurred, the court relied on expert conclusions stating that the music video still contained material “propagandising non-traditional sexual relations and (or) preferences,” and therefore treated the broadcast as unlawful media dissemination rather than mere age-classification error. The exact scenes in question are unclear."@en .
