<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_df007480> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "A Kyrgyzstan citizen was fined and ordered to leave the country for publishing a profile on a website for sex services. According to the court, this individual “promoted non-traditional sexual relations and preferences for sex change.” The exact content that constituted the violation is unknown."@en .
