<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_06124aba> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The streaming service “Wink” was fined for distributing the movie “Danny's Game” (2016, Bill Cooper) and the TV series “The Shannara Chronicles” (2016). The court held that both titles, available with age ratings of 12+ and 16+, contained material “demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations” and therefore had been unlawfully made accessible to minors. The exact scenes that constituted the violation are unclear."@en .
