<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_4c928da2> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The streaming service “Kinopoisk” was fined for two films available to minors, because they “demonstrated non-traditional sexual relations or preferences”, according to the court. These films were “Breaking Up in Rome” (2021, Edoardo Leo) and “Clouds of Sils Maria” (2014, Olivier Assayas). The exact scenes are unclear."@en .
