<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_d6f20fee> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The project manager at “Mangalib”, a platform for online comics and manga, was prosecuted for several publications. The title of the publication in this case has been redacted from the ruling, but the court stated that it depicted romantic and sexual interaction between male characters. This individual was fined at least 12 times for different publications. The company “MangaLib” was also fined at least 12 times."@en .
