<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_e6ee3bdb> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "A Ukrainian citizen was found guilty of “promoting non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences or sex change” via the internet. The court did not specify the exact content that constituted the violation. As the judge reasoned, because the defendant was registered in one of the occupied Ukrainian regions, “he cannot be subject to deportation outside the Russian Federation”, so the defendant was arrested."@en .
