<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_fd922a00> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The editor-in-chief of the online media “Sports24” was fined for publishing the article titled “The three-time Olympic champion suddenly came out. She kept it a secret for over 12 years.” The judicial experts from Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, determined that this article “was structured in such a way that it created a socio-psychological attitude not only of approval of non-traditional sexual relations, but also formed a distorted idea of the social equivalence of traditional and non-traditional sexual relations”. Picture: a screenshot of the article's title."@en .
