<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_885a7488> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The creator of the YouTube channel “HAOYANG & GELA”, a Chinese national, was detained and then ordered to leave the country after the Ministry of Internal Affairs in Kazan established that 19 videos he uploaded “depicted non-traditional sexual relations.” The court described the videos showing two individuals “being male, they kiss each other, hug, touch each other on various parts of the body, including the genital area.” There are also several video titles mentioned in the case, such as “How do gay couples sleep? Kiss me all night long”, “We're back, a love story in the land of hate”, “Watch us recreate kissing scenes”, “I want to hold you while I sleep”, “Who knows me better, my boyfriend or my best friend?”, “Our first time, candid stories”, “Our favourite positions during...”, “25 Types of kissing with my boyfriend”. It is said that the police also “established that out of 64.9K subscribers [of the YouTube channel], 1,791 were minors”, so the judge argued that the videos promoted “non-traditional sexual relations” and “desire to change sex” among minors."@en .
