<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_4bb4392a> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The editor-in-chief of the online media “Sports24” was fined for publishing the article titled “The three-time Olympic champion suddenly came out. She kept it a secret for over 12 years.” on the news aggregator website “Dzen”. The judicial experts from Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, stated that the article was “aimed at forming a positive attitude towards non-traditional sexual relationships and preferences.” This individual was already fined by the same court for the same article published on the media's website (see case 5-672/2025)."@en .
