<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_49a11bc6> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The editor-in-chief of the TV channel “Fon Music” was fined for airing a music video 698 times, which “contained information demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations,” expressed in a scene of “kissing between two persons of the same biological sex (female)”. The exact video is unknown."@en .
