<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_185f36a3> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "An activist held a single protest in the city centre, holding a banner that read, “Look at me. #TDOV — Transgender Day of Visibility.” In addition to the banner, the court recognised another “evidence” of the “promotion of the non-traditional sexual relations among minors”, which was rainbow-coloured knee socks the activist wore during the protest."@en .
