<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_e45b5392> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The editor-in-chief of the TV channel “TV-3 Russia” was fined for airing the film “Piranha 3D” (Alexandre Aja, 2010) twice with the label “16+”. Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, identified two scenes in the film “demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations” among minors: “a girl licking salt off another girl’s body and a prolonged kiss expressing sexual passion (timestamps 00:51:10–00:51:28 and 00:55:21–00:55:39).”"@en .
