<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_8de1ce86> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The TV channel “NTS” was fined for airing the music video “Indie Rock Vogue” by LOBODA (2021). According to the court, the video demonstrated “non-traditional sexual relations [...] expressed in the interaction of two persons of the same biological sex (female) - a model and a photographer, positioned as having a special personal meaning, contain communicative signs of romantic interpersonal relationships.”"@en .
