<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_2f27a2c6> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The streaming service “Wink” was fined for distributing content that the court classified as propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations. The ruling stated that the platform had disseminated information “aimed at forming non-traditional sexual attitudes, creating the attractiveness of non-traditional sexual relations and preferences, and a distorted perception of the social equivalence of traditional and non-traditional sexual relations,” as well as imposing information capable of generating interest in such relations. The exact content that constituted the violation has been redacted in the court ruling."@en .
