<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_cb104acd> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasPenalty> <https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#pen_fine_dc9d9597> .
<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_de0d66cb> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The editor-in-chief of “Sports.ru” was fined for the article “Stonewall, the English club that changed football”. According to the court, this article “creates a socio-psychological attitude not only of approval of non-traditional sexual relations, but also forms a distorted idea of the social equivalence of traditional and non-traditional sexual relations”, because it “presents information about LGBT people in a purely positive light.” The outlet removed the article from its website."@en .
