<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_e185fbee> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The editor-in-chief of the newspaper “Tvoi den'” was fined for publishing the article “I don't consider sex with a girlfriend to be cheating on my husband”, discussing romantic and sexual relationships between women, which authorities classified as inappropriate for distribution to minors and treated as unlawful promotion of same-sex relationships."@en .
<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_3228cdf2> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasPenalty> <https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#pen_fine_784acc8d> .
