<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_f547a1bd> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "An individual was prosecuted for posting images on VKontakte. The image in question depicted two women kissing with the text “I now declare you husband and wife.” The judicial expert concluded that this image “contains psychological and linguistic signs of propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations, expressed in the dissemination of information and the performance of public actions aimed at the formation of non-traditional sexual attitudes, the attractiveness of non-traditional sexual relations, and a distorted idea of ​​the social equivalence of traditional and non-traditional sexual relations and preferences.” This case was initiated by the “Cyber ​​Squad” project of the public movement “People's Front for Russia”, which identifies potentially “destructive content” and submits complaints to authorities."@en .
