<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_40142de8> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "A VKontakte user was fined for posting images “containing persons of the same sex (gender)”. According to the court, these images were the “signs of propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations, propaganda of norms of non-traditional sexual relations”. It is not specified which images exactly constituted the violation. This individual was fined nine times by the same judge for posting images on VK."@en .
