<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_2f4ec4de> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The organiser of the “Spirit of Fire” film festival was fined for the textual description of the Russian film “Outlaw” (Ksenia Ratushnaya, 2020) on the festival website that read “A gay high school student and a young criminal are trying to win back the most popular guy in the school. An army general and a transgender dancer in 1985 put career and life on the line to be together.”"@en .
