<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_b47970a6> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "A VKontakte user was fined for posting a picture depicting “homosexual relationships between men, the content of which promotes non-traditional sexual relations”, according to the court. The exact content that constituted the violation is unknown."@en .
