<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_6679c2c9> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The editor-in-chief of the local newspaper, “Young Far Easterner”, was fined for the article “History with Gayography.” This article tells a story of an openly gay school geography teacher in Khabarovsk who was fired because of his sexual orientation. The court found that this article “promoted non-traditional sexual relations among minors”."@en .
