<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_6808977c> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "A user of the dating app for gay men “Hornet” was fined for posting his photo on his dating profile, which, according to the court, constituted “propaganda of non-traditional same-sex sexual relations, including group ones”. The amount of the fine has been redacted from the court ruling."@en .
