<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_4208b34f> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The TV channel “TV Tsentr – Moscow” was fined for broadcasting the programme “The Nineties” (2016). According to the court, the episode “The beauty queens” demonstrated “non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences” in the scene, in which two women embracing and kissing: “In 2009, the fifty-two-year-old world tennis star announced that she had found herself a new girlfriend [...] two years later, she said that, with the help of her beloved, she had overcome a terrible illness and proposed marriage. The women entered into a happy marriage...” Earlier, the TV channel's deputy director was also fined for broadcasting this programme (see case 05-1326/374/2024)."@en .
