<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_fc6fc50a> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "An individual was fined for “promoting non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences, sex change or refusal of child bearing” by posting three images on the Telegram channel “Free People glavny” in 2023. The police discovered the images during a social media monitoring operation. The judicial expertise concluded that the images depicted “scenes of sexual interaction between three female persons”, “the characters' posture and position relative to each other express their amorous and erotic attraction to each other”, and that these images were “not used to criticise LGBT people”. The same individual was fined at least four times on the same day by the same judge for posting images on this Telegram channel."@en .
