<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_a0028f26> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The online streaming platform “Okko” was fined for the film “Black Ghosts” (Andreas Marawell, 2015), labelled “16+”. The court mentioned the timecodes of four scenes, which “demonstrated non-traditional sexual relations and preferences” to minors: 00:11:10-00:12:57; 00:15:46-00:16:54; 01:33:41-01:35:07; 01:29:19-01:31:42. It is not specified what these scenes depicted. The deputy general director of the streaming platform was also fined for the same film (see case 5-2433/2025-162)."@en .
