<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_84d23455> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "A foreign individual from Tajikistan was prosecuted after police inspected his Telegram account and concluded that the content published there amounted to “propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations”. According to the inspection record, police found that the account was not only storing material but also advertising intimate services: the judgment states that the defendant presented himself as an “active bisexual” and offered “both heterosexual and homosexual services” through private messages on Telegram."@en .
