<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_9ff5e6f3> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The project manager at “Mangalib”, a platform for online comics and manga, was prosecuted for several publications. The publication in this case is the manga “Reincarnation Coliseum: The Weakest Skill Conquers the Strongest Women and Creates a Harem” (Harawata Saizou, 2022), which “depicted romantic and/or sexual relationships between female characters”. This individual was fined at least 12 times for different publications. The company “MangaLib” was also fined at least 12 times."@en .
