<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_9031086c> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "A VKontakte user was fined for publishing a photo depicting “two semi-nude men engaging in sexual acts”. According to the court, this photo “was aimed at promoting LGBT and non-traditional sexual orientation.” The exact photo is unknown. The amount of the fine has been redacted from the court ruling. This individual was fined four times by the same judge on the same day for posting on VK."@en .
