<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_c13a3ebb> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "“Kometa-Plus”, the manufacturer of the board game “Forfeits”, was fined for “dissemination of information aimed at developing non-traditional sexual attitudes in minors”, according to the court. As the judicial expertise stated, “individual elements of the game [...] directly and indirectly promote homosexuality”. The game asked the players to roleplay different situations, such as “Pretend to be a same-sex couple on a date” and “Portray a man-loving Rambo” (text on the chips). Earlier, the general director of the company was also fined for distributing the same board game (see case 12-28/2014)."@en .
