<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_5e7787b8> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "Yuliya Tsvetkova, an artist and activist from Komsomolsk-on-Amur, was fined for two social media posts expressing support for young subscribers of the VKontakte group “The Last Supper – LGBTQIAP+on-Amur” accompanied by images of cartoon cats coloured in queer flags. Yulia appealed the court decision twice, but the cassation court upheld the punishment."@en .
