<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_2bee7c81> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "A Tajikistan citizen was detained for 15 days and ordered to leave the country for posting “an ad offering sexual services in a non-traditional form” on VKontakte. The court found the post to be promoting “non-traditional sexual relations” because it contained the text “Transsexual Sochi versatile big active [phone number]” supplemented by nude images, while indicating [the defendant's] male identity.”"@en .
