<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_dfe1eec5> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "A Tajikistan citizen was detained for 10 days and ordered to leave the country for posts on Telegram, which, according to the court, were “aimed at developing non-traditional sexual attitudes.” The court stated that in these posts the defendant “offered intimate services, posing as a 'transsexual', a person who partially changed sex.” The exact content that constituted the violation is unknown."@en .
<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#mentioned_in_e9f92480> <https://dataout.org/ontology#sourceCategory> <https://dataout.org/ontology#massMediaPublication> .
