<https://dataout.org/rdf/reference/ru_law#article_6_21_part_6> <https://schema.org/description> "Distributing information or carrying out public actions intended to promote “non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences, sex change, or refusal to have children” among minors by a foreign national or stateless person. Punishment: RUB 100K–200K fine with administrative expulsion from Russia, or detention for up to 15 days with subsequent expulsion."@en .
