<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_448e22b0> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The TV channel “TV 1000 Comedy” was fined for showing the film “American Pie 2” (J.B. Rogers, 2001). According to the court, it “promoted non-traditional sexual relationships” because of the scene with “two naked women kissing”."@en .
