<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#pen_fine_a5334231> <https://dataout.org/ontology#penaltyValue> _:nb339817b2c8941f983f86810fb398ca2b183 .
<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#source_9353e830> <https://dataout.org/ontology#courtDocumentDate> "2025-08-29"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_5c3f1784> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "An individual was fined for posting videos and pictures on VKontakte and Telegram. The court provided six links to Telegram posts and two to VK posts. The judicial experts identified in the videos “a combination of linguistic and psychological features promoting non-traditional sexual relations (not between a man and a woman), which is expressed by a positive assessment of such relations as correct, justifying the need for sexual relations not between a man and a woman.” The experts characterised the pictures as “erotic”, which were used by the defendant to “promote the ideas of LGBT”. The exact videos and pictures are no longer available online."@en .
