<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_83c3f5b7> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "An individual was fined for a profile on a website, which “advertised sex services”. According to the court, the textual and visual information in the profile is “unambiguously aimed at popularizing and promoting non-traditional sexual relations, including among minors, and may contribute to the emergence of interest in children and adolescents in non-traditional forms of sexual behavior.” The court mentioned that “the page contains information that [the defendant] is a person of non-traditional sexual orientation, that is, a transsexual.” The defendant explained that she identifies as a woman and provides sex services only to men, which “exludes non-traditionalism”."@en .
