<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_392b97e6> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The project manager at “Mangalib”, a platform for online comics and manga, was prosecuted for several publications. The publication in this case is the manga titled “Share” (Mitsuha Yuu, 2018). According to the court, this manga's illustrations “contained non-episodic depictions of non-traditional sexual relationships between characters, represented by illustrations of male characters in a romantic and sexual context: hugs, kisses, sex, etc.” This individual was fined at least 12 times for different publications. The company “MangaLib” was also fined at least 12 times."@en .
