<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_3454df9a> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "Two men were prosecuted for “promoting non-traditional sexual relations, which included oral sex in a public place” (see also case 05-0486/2024). The defendant in this case, a foreign national, was also ordered to leave the country."@en .
