<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_8c6502e8> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "An individual was fined for “promoting non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences, sex change or refusal of child bearing” by posting an image on the Telegram channel “Free People glavny” in 2023. The police discovered the image during a social media monitoring operation. The judicial expertise concluded that the image depicted “scenes of sexual interaction between two persons of the same sex (women), one of whom is shown kneeling in front of the other”, and that this image was “not used to criticise LGBT people”. The same individual was fined at least four times on the same day by the same judge for posting images on this Telegram channel."@en .
