<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_4a8cfdcd> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The project manager at “Mangalib”, a platform for online comics and manga, was prosecuted for several publications. The publication in this case is “Banana Fish” (Yoshida Akimi, 1985). The court stated that it “depicted romantic and/or sexual relationships between men”. This individual was fined at least 12 times for different publications. The company “MangaLib” was also fined at least 12 times."@en .
