<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_2db8a5f6> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The director of the company “Kometa-Plus” was fined for distributing the board game “Forfeits”, which contained “elements promoting non-traditional sexual relations” among minors, as the mass media reported. The case was initiated after the organisation “Parental Committee of Stavropol” appealed to the prosecutor's office. The game asked the participants to roleplay different situations, such as “Pretend to be a same-sex couple on a date” and “Portray a man-loving Rambo” (text on the chips). The company that manufactured the board game was also fined (see case 7-149/2014)."@en .
