<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_da34f542> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "A Telegram user was fined after prosecutors identified a video featuring the defendant on a channel titled “ЦБ НЕ МИТ.” The ruling states only that the video contained “propaganda of non-traditional same-sex relations” and promoted their attractiveness, but provides no description of the content. The material came to official attention during a separate review of allegedly extremist content."@en .
