<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_df60251a> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The Kaliningrad regional organisation “KAUP” was prosecuted after authorities examined photographs from its June 2025 event “From Sunset to Sunrise.” The court deemed the photos from the festival “propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations and preferences” because they contained “BDSM paraphernalia, a 'BDSM' sign, kissing women, women in revealing outfits, and a woman exposing her breasts.” Evidence in the case included statements from Orthodox, Baptist, Muslim, and Buddhist organizations, which stated that “paraphernalia of the 'BDSM' psychosexual subculture pertains to non-traditional sexual relations and preferences, fosters non-traditional sexual attitudes, and [...] does not correspond to the traditional spiritual and moral values of the Russian Federation.”"@en .
