<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_f8cae0be> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The project manager at “Mangalib”, a platform for online comics and manga, was prosecuted for several publications. The publication in this case is the manga titled “With You, Our Love Will Make It Through” (Yuzuki Chihiro, 2021) about an imaginary interracial relationship. The court stated that it contained “non-episodic depiction of a non-traditional sexual relationship between the main character, represented by several illustrations of a female person with a beast-like creature (perceived as an animal) in a romantic context: kissing, hugging, sensual touching”. This individual was fined at least 12 times for different publications. The company “MangaLib” was also fined at least 12 times."@en .
