<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_1da24f09> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "An individual was fined for posting “images promoting non-traditional sexual orientations among minors.” The exact content is unclear. Initially, a magistrate issued a 300,000 RUB fine to the defendant. The higher instance judge reduced the amount because of such mitigating circumstances as “disability since childhood, presence of mental illness confirmed by medical documents.” In his appeal, the defendant argued that he could not write or read, and the police officers took advantage of it when charging him."@en .
