<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_6ac106d9> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The company “Rostelecom”, a digital services provider, was fined for distributing four films on its streaming platform “Wink” with the age restriction label “16+”. According to the court, these films contained “information demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences.” One of the mentioned films is the sci-fi thriller “Life Like” (Josh Janowicz, 2019). Other titles were redacted in the court decision. It is not specified what scenes exactly constituted the violation."@en .
