<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_e559a9c1> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The project manager at “Mangalib”, a platform for online comics and manga, was prosecuted for several publications. The publication in this case is “The Great Snake’s Bride” (Fushiashikumo, 2021), which, according to the court, “promote non-traditional sexual relationships online” and “contained romantic and erotic illustrations involving a female character and a serpent-like creature”. This individual was fined at least 12 times for different publications. The company “MangaLib” was also fined at least 12 times."@en .
