<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_3a4eb963> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The director of content policy at “Rostelecom” was held administratively liable after regulators found that films distributed through the company’s streaming service “Wink” constituted “propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations”. The films were “Transcendence” (2014, Wally Pfister), “Life Like” (2019, Josh Janowicz), ”Curse of Chucky” (2013, Don Mancini), and ”Blow Dry” (2001, Paddy Breathnach). The exact scenes from these films are unclear."@en .
