<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_44877c04> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasPenalty> <https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#pen_fine_5c55ed39> .
<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_8c72027a> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The company that owns the streaming service “Ivi” was fined for the films “It's Only the End of the World” (Xavier Dolan, 2016) and “Wheel of Fortune and Fantasy” (Ryusuke Hamaguchi, 2021), labelled “16+”. The court found that these films “contained information demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences, which is prohibited for distribution among children.” It is not specified which scenes exactly constituted the violation."@en .
<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#source_3967346a> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <https://dataout.org/rdf/reference/ru_courts#77MS0374> .
<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_cc6d66f0> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "An individual was fined for “publishing the status 'TPerson' with a colored emblem of the LGBT flag” on social media. According to the court's press office, the judicial expertise concluded that the defendant “publicly displayed an illustration of the LGBT flag, which could be perceived by social media users as propaganda for sex change.”"@en .
