<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_c45ac685> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "Yan Dvorkin, head of the support centre for transgender and non-binary people, “Center-T”, was fined for a Telegram post announcing a marriage with such phrases as “So, gay marriages are here to stay!” and “Our insidious plan to legalise same-sex marriage was successful.” The court found Yan's post to be “promoting non-traditional sexual relationships” because the judicial expertise concluded that it presented relationships “not between a man and a woman” in a positive light and characterised such relationships as “natural”. The picture is a screenshot of the post mentioned in the court order."@en .
<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#source_bdf6be38> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <https://dataout.org/rdf/reference/ru_courts#77RS0002> .
