<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_d4875644> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "Two Instagram users were fined for posts “promoting non-traditional sexual relations with a twin brother.” The exact content that constituted the violation is unknown. See also case 05-706/1/2025."@en .
