<https://dataout.org/rdf/reference/ru_law#article_6_21_2_part_2> <https://schema.org/description> "Distributing information among minors demonstrating “non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences”, including descriptions or depictions of such preferences, or information “capable of causing minors to desire to change their sex” via mass media or internet. Does not apply to cases covered by part 4 of Article 6.21. Individuals may be fined RUB 100K–200K; officials RUB 200K–400K; and legal entities RUB 1M–4M, or have their activities suspended for up to 90 days."@en .
