<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_aafc0f08> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The general director of the company “Tema-Rus” and the editor-in-chief of a TV channel (the court redacted the name), which the company manages, was fined for “propaganda among minors of non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences”. The exact content that constituted the violation and the amount of fine have been redacted from the court ruling. Earlier, this legal entity was fined for airing a TV programme (see case 5-1024/2023)."@en .
