<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_c239abae> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "An LGBTQIA+ activist was fined for posts on VKontakte. The court stated that these posts “contained propaganda of non-traditional same-sex sexual relations aimed at forming attractiveness [to such relations].” According to the mass media, the posts were six pictures, “two of which depicted LGBT flags, another picture had a drawing of boys kissing, and the rest of the images were rainbow-colored.”"@en .
