<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_ed66af93> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The legal entity “FONBET TV”, which owns the music TV channel “TNT Music”, was fined for airing the music video “Hallucination” by Regard and Years & Years, labelled “16+”. According to the court, the music video “demonstrated non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences” among minors. The experts from Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, identified two scenes, in which gestures made by “persons of the male biological sex [...] encourage the recipient to perceive their dance as an expression of sexual interaction between persons of the same biological sex.” The editor-in-chief of this TV channel was also fined for the same content (see case 5-1072/23)."@en .
