<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_60e960a7> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "A VKontakte user was fined for posting screenshots of the music video “Take me to church”. The court stated that “it can be reliably determined that the images contain persons of the same sex (gender), therefore there are signs of propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations, propaganda of norms of non-traditional sexual relations among minors”. This individual was fined nine times by the same judge for posting images on VK."@en .
<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_b581f6a2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://dataout.org/ontology#MonitoringRecord> .
<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_f264cb14> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "“MangaLib”, a platform for online comics and manga, was fined for publications on its website. The publication in this case is “The Great Snake’s Bride” (Fushiashikumo, 2021). From the court decision: “This material, represented by one volume of 26 chapters, tells the story of a girl forced to marry a Snake (a giant snake). Initially, the girl is afraid of her husband, but soon the Snake succeeds in winning the young wife's affections, after which the characters begin an intimate relationship. The material contains non-episodic depictions of non-traditional sexual relations, represented by several illustrations of a female character (the main character) with a beast-like creature (perceived as a snake) in a romantic and erotic context: kissing, hugging, sensual touching, and sexually explicit actions. Therefore, the presented manga [...] contains information promoting non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences due to the systematic distribution of materials with non-episodic depictions and/or descriptions of non-traditional sexual relations.” The court stated that “the information displayed can be classified as revealing signs of a socio-cultural threat to the national security of the Russian Federation in terms of the protection of traditional values, since it reveals signs of ideological and psychological influence on the recipient in the form of the imposition of a destructive ideology (propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations).” This is one of at least 12 cases in a serial persecution of “MangaLib”. The manager of “MangaLib” was also prosecuted at least 12 times for different publications."@en .
