<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_ecee4623> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "The editor-in-chief of “Clubbing TV” was fined for airing several music videos labelled “16+.” According to Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, these videos “demonstrated non-traditional sexual relations and (or) preferences, including descriptions, depictions of non-traditional sexual relations and (or) preferences, or capable of causing a desire in minors to change sex, using mass media.” The court did not specify which videos or scenes violated the law."@en .
