<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_a66d47a6> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "An individual who attended a drag performance at a Halloween party in the nightclub “Dark Horse” in Yaroslavl was fined after the police raided the club. The details of this case are unknown; the court did not publish the decision. The mass media reported that during the raid, the police forced the club's visitors to lie on the floor for several hours; some people were beaten; several performers were detained, and seven administrative cases were initiated. We found eight such cases on the court website, six of which resulted in a punishment. This is one of these cases."@en .
