<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_298fede9> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "An Uzbekistan citizen was detained for one day and ordered to leave the country for publishing a profile on a website for sex services. According to the court, on this website, this individual “carried out propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations and preferences for sex change, committed among minors.” The exact content that constituted the violation is unknown."@en .
<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_cdbbc2e8> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasTriggerObject> <https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#OL35324964M> .
<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#source_8e0e2021> <https://dataout.org/ontology#courtDocumentDate> "2023-11-24"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_7cc96737> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "A foreign national was fined and ordered to leave the country for posting a profile on the trans women escort website. The court decision states that the profile was “aimed at developing non-traditional sexual relations” because its creator, “being a male, posts photos of himself in female guise, specifically in women's clothing (a skirt), with signs of female breasts, with long blond hair, makeup, and with exposed male genitalia (penis).”"@en .
