<https://dataout.org/rdf/data/project-6-21#record_ad890379> <https://dataout.org/ontology#hasSnippet> "An individual was fined for “promoting non-traditional sexual relations” in public by “positioning himself as a female, displaying his appearance, namely by wearing a women's shirt, women's short shorts, women's sunglasses, a red cap, lipstick, and a manicure with artificial nails painted pink.” This individual was fined twice for wearing “women's clothing” (see aslo 5-440/2025)."@en .
